   "source": [
    "# 评估智能体\n",
    "\n",
    "我们有一个使用路由器对电子邮件进行分类的电子邮件助手，然后将电子邮件传递给智能体进行回复生成。我们如何确保它在生产环境中能够良好运行？这就是测试的重要性：它通过可量化的指标（如响应质量、令牌使用量、延迟或分类准确性）来指导我们对智能体架构的决策。[LangSmith](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/) 提供了两种主要的智能体测试方法。\n",
    "\n",
    "![overview-img](img/overview_eval.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4d7f7048",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 加载环境变量"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "c47d4c3d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "load_dotenv(\"../.env\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2005c34d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 如何运行评估\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Pytest / Vitest\n",
    "\n",
    "[Pytest](https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/) 和 Vitest 在许多开发者中以在 Python 和 JavaScript 生态系统中编写测试的强大工具而闻名。LangSmith 与这些框架集成，允许您编写和运行将结果记录到 LangSmith 的测试。对于此notebook，我们将使用 Pytest。\n",
    "* Pytest 对于已经熟悉其框架的开发者来说是一个很好的入门方式。\n",
    "* Pytest 非常适合更复杂的评估，其中每个智能体测试用例需要特定的检查和成功标准，这些很难泛化。\n",
    "\n",
    "#### LangSmith 数据集\n",
    "\n",
    "您还可以[在 LangSmith 中创建数据集](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/evaluation)，并使用 LangSmith evaluate API 对数据集运行我们的助手。\n",
    "* LangSmith 数据集非常适合协作构建测试套件的团队。\n",
    "* 您可以利用生产跟踪、注释队列、合成数据生成等，将示例添加到不断增长的黄金数据集中。\n",
    "* LangSmith 数据集适合于可以应用于数据集中每个测试用例的评估器（例如相似性、精确匹配准确性等）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "10b7c989",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 测试用例\n",
    "\n",
    "测试通常从定义测试用例开始，这可能是一个具有挑战性的过程。在这种情况下，我们将只定义一组我们想要处理的示例电子邮件以及一些要测试的内容。您可以在 `eval/email_dataset.py` 中看到测试用例，其中包含以下内容：\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **输入电子邮件**：多样化的电子邮件示例集合\n",
    "2. **真实分类**：`响应`、`通知`、`忽略`\n",
    "3. **预期工具调用**：每封需要回复的电子邮件调用的工具\n",
    "4. **响应标准**：对于需要回复的电子邮件，什么构成良好的响应\n",
    "\n",
    "请注意，我们既有\n",
    "- 端到端"集成"测试（例如 输入电子邮件 -> 智能体 -> 最终输出 vs 响应标准）\n",
    "- 工作流中特定步骤的测试（例如 输入电子邮件 -> 智能体 -> 分类 vs 真实分类）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f8fdc2b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%load_ext autoreload\n",
    "%autoreload 2\n",
    "\n",
    "from email_assistant.eval.email_dataset import email_inputs, expected_tool_calls, triage_outputs_list, response_criteria_list\n",
    "\n",
    "test_case_ix = 0\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"电子邮件输入:\", email_inputs[test_case_ix])\n",
    "print(\"预期分类输出:\", triage_outputs_list[test_case_ix])\n",
    "print(\"预期工具调用:\", expected_tool_calls[test_case_ix])\n",
    "print(\"响应标准:\", response_criteria_list[test_case_ix])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2337bd7c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pytest 示例\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们看看如何使用 Pytest 为工作流的特定部分编写测试。我们将测试我们的 `email_assistant` 在回复电子邮件时是否进行了正确的工具调用。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "ae92fe30",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pytest\n",
    "from email_assistant.eval.email_dataset import email_inputs, expected_tool_calls\n",
    "from email_assistant.utils import format_messages_string\n",
    "from email_assistant.email_assistant import email_assistant\n",
    "from email_assistant.utils import extract_tool_calls\n",
    "\n",
    "from langsmith import testing as t\n",
    "\n",
    "@pytest.mark.langsmith\n",
    "@pytest.mark.parametrize(\n",
    "    \"email_input, expected_calls\",\n",
    "    [   # 选择一些预期有电子邮件回复的示例\n",
    "        (email_inputs[0],expected_tool_calls[0]),\n",
    "        (email_inputs[3],expected_tool_calls[3]),\n",
    "    ],\n",
    ")\n",
    "def test_email_dataset_tool_calls(email_input, expected_calls):\n",
    "    \"\"\"测试电子邮件处理是否包含预期的工具调用。\n",
    "    \n",
    "    此测试确认在电子邮件处理期间调用了所有预期的工具，\n",
    "    但不检查工具调用的顺序或每个工具的调用次数。\n",
    "    如果需要，可以添加对这些方面的额外检查。\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    # 运行电子邮件助手\n",
    "    messages = [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": str(email_input)}]\n",
    "    result = email_assistant.invoke({\"messages\": messages})\n",
    "            \n",
    "    # 从消息列表中提取工具调用\n",
    "    extracted_tool_calls = extract_tool_calls(result['messages'])\n",
    "            \n",
    "    # 检查所有预期的工具调用是否在提取的调用中\n",
    "    missing_calls = [call for call in expected_calls if call.lower() not in extracted_tool_calls]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    t.log_outputs({\n",
    "                \"missing_calls\": missing_calls,\n",
    "                \"extracted_tool_calls\": extracted_tool_calls,\n",
    "                \"response\": format_messages_string(result['messages'])\n",
    "            })\n",
    "\n",
    "    # 如果没有预期的调用丢失，测试通过\n",
    "    assert len(missing_calls) == 0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "700aba2a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "您会注意到几件事。\n",
    "- 要[使用 Pytest 运行并将测试结果记录到 LangSmith](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/evaluation/how_to_guides/pytest)，我们只需要将 `@pytest.mark.langsmith` 装饰器添加到我们的函数中并将其放在文件中，如您在 `notebooks/test_tools.py` 中看到的。这将把测试结果记录到 LangSmith。\n",
    "- 其次，我们可以通过 `@pytest.mark.parametrize` 将数据集示例传递给测试函数，如[这里](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/evaluation/how_to_guides/pytest#parametrize-with-pytestmarkparametrize)所示。\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 运行 Pytest\n",
    "我们可以从命令行运行测试。我们已经在 Python 文件中定义了上述代码。从项目根目录运行：\n",
    "\n",
    "`! LANGSMITH_TEST_SUITE='Email assistant: Test Tools For Interrupt'  pytest notebooks/test_tools.py`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "53165e98",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 查看实验结果\n",
    "\n",
    "我们可以在 LangSmith UI 中查看结果。`assert len(missing_calls) == 0` 被记录到 LangSmith 的 `Pass` 列中。`log_outputs` 被传递到 `Outputs` 列，函数参数被传递到 `Inputs` 列。在 `@pytest.mark.parametrize(` 中传递的每个输入都是记录到 LangSmith 中 `LANGSMITH_TEST_SUITE` 项目名称的单独行，该项目名称在 `Datasets & Experiments` 下找到。\n",
    "\n",
    "![Test Results](img/test_result.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fd325e27",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## LangSmith 数据集示例\n",
    "\n",
    "![overview-img](img/eval_detail.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "让我们看看如何使用 LangSmith 数据集运行评估。在之前使用 Pytest 的示例中，我们评估了电子邮件助手的工具调用准确性。现在，我们要在这里评估的数据集专门用于电子邮件助手的分类步骤，分类电子邮件是否需要回复。\n",
    "\n",
    "#### 数据集定义\n",
    "\n",
    "我们可以[在 LangSmith 中创建数据集](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/evaluation/how_to_guides/manage_datasets_programmatically#create-a-dataset)，使用 LangSmith SDK。下面的代码使用 `eval/email_dataset.py` 文件中的测试用例创建数据集。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7ea997ac",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from langsmith import Client\n",
    "\n",
    "from email_assistant.eval.email_dataset import examples_triage\n",
    "\n",
    "# 初始化 LangSmith 客户端\n",
    "client = Client()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 数据集名称\n",
    "dataset_name = \"电子邮件分类评估\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# 如果数据集不存在则创建\n",
    "if not client.has_dataset(dataset_name=dataset_name):\n",
    "    dataset = client.create_dataset(\n",
    "        dataset_name=dataset_name, \n",
    "        description=\"电子邮件及其分类决策的数据集。\"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    # 向数据集添加示例\n",
    "    client.create_examples(dataset_id=dataset.id, examples=examples_triage)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0b2df606",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 目标函数\n",
    "\n",
    "数据集具有以下结构，电子邮件输入和电子邮件的真实分类作为输出：\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "examples_triage = [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "      \"inputs\": {\"email_input\": email_input_1},\n",
    "      \"outputs\": {\"classification\": triage_output_1},   # 注意：这在创建的数据集中成为 reference_output\n",
    "  }, ...\n",
    "]\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f7d7e83f-3006-4386-9230-786545c7b1a1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"数据集示例输入 (inputs):\", examples_triage[0]['inputs'])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f292f070-7af6-4370-9338-e90bfd6b3d42",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"数据集示例参考输出 (reference_outputs):\", examples_triage[0]['outputs'])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8290e820",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "我们定义一个函数，它接收数据集输入并将其传递给我们的电子邮件助手。LangSmith [evaluate API](https://docs.smith.langchain.com/evaluation) 将 `inputs` 字典传递给此函数。然后此函数返回包含智能体输出的字典。因为我们正在评估分类步骤，所以我们只需要返回分类决策。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "0b9d1ded",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def target_email_assistant(inputs: dict) -> dict:\n",
    "    \"\"\"通过基于工作流的电子邮件助手处理电子邮件。\"\"\"\n",
    "    response = email_assistant.nodes['triage_router'].invoke({\"email_input\": inputs[\"email_input\"]})\n",
    "    return {\"classification_decision\": response.update['classification_decision']}"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5ba6ec4c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 评估器函数\n",
    "\n",
    "现在，我们创建一个评估器函数。我们想要评估什么？我们在数据集中有参考输出，在上面的函数中定义了智能体输出。\n",
    "\n",
    "* 参考输出：`\"reference_outputs\": {\"classification\": triage_output_1} ...`\n",
    "* 智能体输出：`\"outputs\": {\"classification_decision\": agent_output_1} ...`\n",
    "\n",
    "我们想要评估智能体的输出是否与参考输出匹配。所以我们只需要一个比较两者的评估器函数，其中 `outputs` 是智能体的输出，`reference_outputs` 是数据集中的参考输出。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "4fee7532",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def classification_evaluator(outputs: dict, reference_outputs: dict) -> bool:\n",
    "    \"\"\"检查答案是否与预期答案完全匹配。\"\"\"\n",
    "    return outputs[\"classification_decision\"].lower() == reference_outputs[\"classification\"].lower()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "50fd2de9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 运行评估\n",
    "\n",
    "现在，问题是：这些东西是如何连接在一起的？evaluate API 为我们处理了这个问题。它将数据集中的 `inputs` 字典传递给目标函数。它将数据集中的 `reference_outputs` 字典传递给评估器函数。它将我们智能体的 `outputs` 传递给评估器函数。\n",
    "\n",
    "请注意，这与我们在 Pytest 中所做的类似：在 Pytest 中，我们使用 `@pytest.mark.parametrize` 将数据集示例输入和参考输出传递给测试函数。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "6807306d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 如果您想启动评估，请设置为 true\n",
    "run_expt = True\n",
    "if run_expt:\n",
    "    experiment_results_workflow = client.evaluate(\n",
    "        # 运行智能体\n",
    "        target_email_assistant,\n",
    "        # 数据集名称\n",
    "        data=dataset_name,\n",
    "        # 评估器\n",
    "        evaluators=[classification_evaluator],\n",
    "        # 实验名称\n",
    "        experiment_prefix=\"电子邮件助手工作流\", \n",
    "        # 并发评估数量\n",
    "        max_concurrency=2, \n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "76baff88",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "我们可以在 LangSmith UI 中查看两个实验的结果。\n",
    "\n",
    "![Test Results](img/eval.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c5146b52",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## LLM 作为评判者的评估\n",
    "\n",
    "我们已经展示了分类步骤的单元测试（使用 evaluate()）和工具调用（使用 Pytest）。\n",
    "\n",
    "我们将展示如何使用 LLM 作为评判者来根据一套成功标准评估我们智能体的执行。\n",
    "\n",
    "![types](img/eval_types.png)\n",
    "\n",
    "首先，我们为包含评分和评分理由的 LLM 评分器定义结构化输出模式。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "e1d342b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from pydantic import BaseModel, Field\n",
    "from langchain.chat_models import init_chat_model\n",
    "\n",
    "class CriteriaGrade(BaseModel):\n",
    "    \"\"\"根据特定标准对响应进行评分。\"\"\"\n",
    "    justification: str = Field(description=\"评分的理由和分数，包括响应中的具体例子。\")\n",
    "    grade: bool = Field(description=\"响应是否符合提供的标准？\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "# 创建用于评估的全局 LLM，避免为每个测试重新创建\n",
    "criteria_eval_llm = init_chat_model(\"openai:gpt-4o\")\n",
    "criteria_eval_structured_llm = criteria_eval_llm.with_structured_output(CriteriaGrade)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "bec02b18",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "email_input = email_inputs[0]\n",
    "print(\"电子邮件输入:\", email_input)\n",
    "success_criteria = response_criteria_list[0]\n",
    "print(\"成功标准:\", success_criteria)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "38390ccd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "我们的电子邮件助手使用电子邮件输入调用，响应被格式化为字符串。然后所有这些都传递给 LLM 评分器以接收评分和评分理由。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "cbff28fc",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "response = email_assistant.invoke({\"email_input\": email_input})"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d64619fb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from email_assistant.eval.prompts import RESPONSE_CRITERIA_SYSTEM_PROMPT\n",
    "\n",
    "all_messages_str = format_messages_string(response['messages'])\n",
    "eval_result = criteria_eval_structured_llm.invoke([\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"system\",\n",
    "            \"content\": RESPONSE_CRITERIA_SYSTEM_PROMPT},\n",
    "        {\"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "            \"content\": f\"\"\"\\n\\n 响应标准：{success_criteria} \\n\\n 助手的响应：\\n\\n {all_messages_str} \\n\\n 评估助手的响应是否符合标准，并为您的评估提供理由。\"\"\"}\n",
    "    ])\n",
    "\n",
    "eval_result"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "64275647-6fdb-4bf3-806b-4dbc770cbd6f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "RESPONSE_CRITERIA_SYSTEM_PROMPT"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7994952c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "我们可以看到 LLM 评分器返回一个评估结果，其模式与我们的 `CriteriaGrade` 基础模型匹配。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0b44111d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 对更大的测试套件运行\n",
    "现在我们已经看到了如何使用 Pytest 和 evaluate() 评估我们的智能体，并看到了使用 LLM 作为评判者的示例，我们可以在更大的测试套件上使用评估，以更好地了解我们的智能体在更广泛的示例中的表现。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9280d5ae-3070-4131-8763-454073176081",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "让我们对更大的测试套件运行我们的 email_assistant。\n",
    "```\n",
    "! LANGSMITH_TEST_SUITE='Email assistant: Test Full Response Interrupt' LANGSMITH_EXPERIMENT='email_assistant' pytest tests/test_response.py --agent-module email_assistant\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "在 `test_response.py` 中，您可以看到几件事。\n",
    "\n",
    "我们将数据集示例传递到将运行 pytest 并记录到我们的 `LANGSMITH_TEST_SUITE` 的函数中：\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "# 参考输出键\n",
